# The annotations of the three loading screens (src/screen/screen-rex1.json, screen-rex2.json, screen-demo.json; one
# piece a screen). Format: ../../../../docs/ann-format.md.

@piece rex1
@module screen-rex1 ; REX 1's loading screen
@about Side 1 block 4: the 6912-byte screen saved as Bytes "ds" (its header says start 40000; `LOAD "" SCREEN$` puts it at $4000 all the same). The game's entry clears the screen; no code reads the picture.
$4000 b LoadingScreenRex1 32 ; REX 1's loading screen: 6144 bytes of pixels, 768 of attributes
> Witness: c1 loads it at $4000 (work/stage1/c1/screens); it stays on the screen while the code block loads.
@res screens/rex1.bin

@piece rex2
@module screen-rex2 ; REX 2's loading screen
@about Side 1 block 10: REX 1's picture with 142 bytes changed from offset 2147 (docs/03-build-and-load.md 3.1), saved as Bytes "ds", start 40000, loaded at $4000.
$4000 b LoadingScreenRex2 32 ; REX 2's loading screen: 6144 bytes of pixels, 768 of attributes
> Witness: c2 loads it at $4000 (work/stage1/c2/screens).
@res screens/rex2.bin

@piece demo
@module screen-demo ; DEMO's loading screen
@about Side 2 block 4: REX 2's picture with 97 bytes changed, saved as Bytes "ds", start 40000, loaded at $4000.
$4000 b LoadingScreenDemo 32 ; DEMO's loading screen: 6144 bytes of pixels, 768 of attributes
> Witness: d1 loads it at $4000 (work/stage1/d1/screens).
@res screens/demo.bin
